{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>帶著一家大小出門，行李與證件總教人分身不暇。Packzy 是一款為家庭而設的旅行與行程管理工具，把打包清單、行李限額、證件副本、貨幣換算與位置記錄集中在同一介面，適合經常親子外遊或商務出行的人士。原價 US $0.99，現正限時免費。</p>\n<img alt=\"限時免費\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/460x460bb-75-144.webp\">\n<h2>智能打包清單與證件保管</h2>\n<p>Packzy 為家庭旅行整理好每項細節。你可為每位成員建立專屬打包清單，並快速查閱航空公司行李限額，避免機場額外收費。數碼證件保險箱可存放護照與簽證，離線亦可查閱；配合即時貨幣換算與位置記錄，輕鬆找回酒店或機場。以 Apple 登入可同步資料，訪客模式則只保留在本機。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-257-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-258-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-259-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-260-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-261-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-262-scaled.jpg\">\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Packzy</li>\n<li>應用類別：Travel</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-15T07:47:39.848291+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":303,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-14T05:10:13+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-15T09:18:18.501706+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-15T07:41:18.897132+00:00","content_hash":"f518355380dcfa6b50d9752a6e5c05a555bbb7babbe9c4c1584b51d522bb8e5d","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}